                    power_hawker:           `At the bottom — the hawkers and table-top retailers who touch the consumer`,
                    power_even:             `Evenly spread — no single tier really controls access`,
                    power_distributor:      `With our two formal distributors — they own the route to market`,
                    r1_unlearn_label:       `How much of the modern-trade playbook do you commit to unlearning? (%)`,
                    r1_unlearn_readout:     `Commitment to a purpose-built informal-market approach:`,

                    r2_approach_label:      `Choose your pricing approach for a channel where price is negotiated, not posted.`,
