                    r2_room_readout:        `Bargaining room engineered into the stack:`,
                    r2_arbitrage_label:     `Anti-arbitrage rule to stop a price war between buyers.`,
                    arb_zones:              `Cluster zoning + volume caps so no buyer can flood and undercut the others`,
                    arb_none:               `None — let the market sort it out`,
